# ==============================================================================
# 🚀 MASTER BOILERPLATE .GITIGNORE [ALL MARKED / DISABLED BY DEFAULT]
# ==============================================================================
# CATATAN & PANDUAN PENGGUNAAN:
# Seluruh baris rule di bawah ini sengaja di-MARK (diberi tanda '#') agar seluruh
# daftar terlihat jelas dan siap di-ENABLE (uncomment / hapus tanda '#') di
# project baru Anda sesuai kebutuhan.
#
# CARA MENG-ENABLE:
# 1. Buka file ini di project baru Anda.
# 2. Hapus tanda '#' pada baris yang ingin Anda aktifkan (contoh: hapus '#' pada
#    /node_modules, /vendor, .env, dll.)
# ==============================================================================

# --- [Testing & Cache] ---
/.phpunit.cache
/.phpunit.result.cache

# --- [Build & Assets Output] ---
/bootstrap/ssr
/public/fonts-manifest.dev.json
/public/hot
/public/storage

# --- [Dependencies] ---
/node_modules
/vendor

# --- [Storage & Keys] ---
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
*.log

# --- [Environment & Secrets] ---
.env
.env.backup
.env.production
/auth.json

# --- [OS & IDE Configurations] ---
.DS_Store
.phpactor.json
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
/.fleet
/.idea
/.nova
/.vscode
/.zed
